# Rule: large_outbound_transfer
# Category: Data Exfiltration
# Severity: high
# Attack Class: exfiltration
#
# Detects excessive outbound network activity within a 5-minute window.
# A high volume of outbound connections from the same agent may indicate
# bulk data exfiltration via many small transfers.
#
# Threshold: more than 200 outbound connections in 5 minutes.
# In Phase 2, a bytes_sum() function will allow byte-level thresholds.

event.type == "NETWORK_CONNECT" AND count("NETWORK_CONNECT", "5m") > 200
